chore(ps5): remove dead code left by the Xbox wipe

Removed 41 files that are provably dead, not merely unused-looking:

  * temp_code_test/agentic/ (26) - every script imported the deleted Xbox
    agent layer (from core.config, from tools.registry, from agents.base,
    from gameplay.autonomous_player) so none could even import. Included
    minecraft_launch_sequence_test.py, smoke_test.py, layout_trace.py,
    keyboard_regression_guard.py, type_text_live.py, phase2_* and the
    Xbox run-inspection helpers.
  * temp_code_test/docs/ (2) - verify_docs.py validated the deleted docs/.
  * __pycache__ (10) - regenerated on demand; stale handles here also block
    directory renames on Windows.
  * wipe_xbox.ps1, backup_rig_tools.ps1, .commitmsg - one-shot migration
    helpers, already executed.

Fixed stale references in surviving files:

  * .pre-commit-config.yaml - pointed ruff and check-yaml at
    PS5-Agentic-Testing; dropped the mypy hook until the new layer has
    core/ and agents/ packages.
  * ps5_game_bindings_check.py - was reporting "every game binding
    resolves" while silently checking ZERO bindings, because both game
    configs it named had been deleted. It now discovers *_controls.yaml
    under the PS5 layer and says plainly when there is nothing to check.
    A green result that verifies nothing is the exact failure this project
    exists to avoid.
  * gimx_session_selftest.py - crashed on profiles with config_file: null
    (ps3, xbox_360). That ValueError is the session guard working as
    designed, so it is now reported as "refused by design".
  * temp_code_test/README.md - rewritten for the PS5 tooling; indexes every
    surviving script and the findings documents.

Kept deliberately: temp_code_test/hardware (PS5 rig tooling, all verified
working) and temp_code_test/artifacts (proof frames).

Verified after cleanup:
  ps5_profile_check.py        PASS (26 checks)
  gimx_session_selftest.py    PASS
  test_controller_selftest.py PASS
  capture_warmup_test.py      PASS
  ps5_game_bindings_check.py  honest "nothing to check"
  validate_config.py          25/26 - only the pending folder rename fails
